            "review_title": "Review at Chu Quan Bbq Grill",
            "review_text": "jim s\nSt. Catharines, Canada26 contributions\n0\nBest bbq we have ever had\nJun 2026 • Couples\nThis place is amazing .staff was very attentive and friendly the managers were on point making sure everything was running smooth and we were taking care.the food was outta the world with flavor.that white green chilli sauce was so good I wanted to drink it.if u want a local atmosphere with great music and excellent food this is the place.there was this one waiter that stood out he was running and working his butt off.we came back a second time just cause how well he treated us if you go there and see him give him a high 5 or even better a tip.5/5 ALL DAY LONG\nRead more\nWritten June 21, 2026",
