            "review_text": "Gr00vyTraveller\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia254 contributions\n0\nSmokey and busy\nFeb 2020 • Friends\n7 adults- we ordered some appetizers- bbq pork ribs, prawn fritters, beef salad and french fries. Mains were prawns, octopus, beef, pork on bbq grill. Fish hot pot was tasty and so spicy hot. Hot stone bbq was beef and okra. Had some Vietnamese rice wine too. Place was packed for a week night.\nWritten February 5, 2020",
