            "review_title": "Review at Chu Quan Bbq Grill",
            "review_text": "Robby C\nDa Lat, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nWas good - No TERRIBLE\nOct 2019\nChu used to be really fun - for a local like us it was the place that was busy, crowded, noisy, smoky and fun. All that came with awesome service. HOWEVER, I don't know if they sold the place to someone else, but now that they've moved up the street.. nothing is the same. TERRIBLE service - nobody cares anymore. Price for the food has gone up, and quality / quantity has gone considerably down ( We got literally 9 small chunks of fish for 90k - rediculous! ) ALL IN ALL - nothing different then any other place. No atmosphere any more, no one cares.. just another average BBQ restaurant. What a shame.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 19, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
