            "review_title": "Review at Chu Quan Bbq Grill",
            "review_text": "Travelabroad92\nEastern Norway, Norway23 contributions\n0\nVery bad service\nSep 2019\nI dont like to write bad reviews but this restaurant need too upgrade service attitudes.. We ordered beef hot pot and looked forward to eat some good food. We got table right beside street, suddenly there was a guy with a white dove on the street, placing a gigantic speaker 40 cm away from us. Guy was a street magician and he blasted high volume music like it was a Sonic weapon against us. Restaurant also played music so sitting there in the middle was unbearable. Staff did not want to talk with the guy, did not offer another table and we had to pay full price for food we only got one bite from. Staff did not offer any solution at all despite many people in the staff cold speak English.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 23, 2019",
