            "review_title": "Review at Chu Quan Bbq Grill",
            "review_text": "LangdonCheves\nMedellin, Colombia15 contributions\n1\nonly if you like being splattered by hot oil\nApr 2019 • Friends\nWe showed up here early for dinner. When we first arrived, there were two other tables outside on the patio. The service was so slow, both of them had to walk inside to get their bills. The outside speakers were blaring the sound effects of a children's cartoon, when we asked for music or silence instead we were ignored. The raw meat arrived 5 full minutes before the grill, and then the grill turned out to be just a hot plate that splattered hot oil on the two women in our group- they literally jumped away from the table in pain when the meat was dumped onto the hot plate by the server. There were some other issues, but you get the picture- I don't recommend it. Overall, poor service, high risk of burns, but the food itself was pretty good.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 2, 2019",
